{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dalia, an ancient witch, travels to Tempelburg to attend the Great Sabbath. Delayed by a violent storm, she arrives upon the shore only to witness a dire omen burning in the sky. Something has gone terribly wrong \u2014 the coven is in danger, and she must hurry to discover what has happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the journey, Dalia will recall the ancient principles of magic. By drawing arcane symbols, she weaves powerful spells to aid her on the path ahead. She may charm the common folk to serve her will, or turn to ashes those who dare stand in her way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she ventures deeper, she will uncover the secrets of magical locks and hidden things. By piercing the Veil, she will glimpse truths long concealed and the true intentions of the coven itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she remain loyal to its orders, or follow a path of her own making?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That choice will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3302540?t=1773077016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3302540?t=1773077016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302540/36c691800f1c4015eddcc491102c227ca2356821/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773077016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302540/36c691800f1c4015eddcc491102c227ca2356821/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773077016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dalia, an ancient witch, travels to Tempelburg to attend the Great Sabbath. Delayed by a violent storm, she arrives upon the shore only to witness a dire omen burning in the sky. Something has gone terribly wrong \u2014 the coven is in danger, and she must hurry to discover what has happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the journey, Dalia will recall the ancient principles of magic. By drawing arcane symbols, she weaves powerful spells to aid her on the path ahead. She may charm the common folk to serve her will, or turn to ashes those who dare stand in her way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she ventures deeper, she will uncover the secrets of magical locks and hidden things. By piercing the Veil, she will glimpse truths long concealed and the true intentions of the coven itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she remain loyal to its orders, or follow a path of her own making?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That choice will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: </p>","developers":["State of the Art Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302540/12042382e4f6f734d9a3ba9a66881f520d1cf736/header.jpg?t=1773077016","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3302540/65453968/2534c7bb953dd0a6110c95e4c4427475e2b92bcb/1750977327/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748918473","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3302540/65453968/2534c7bb953dd0a6110c95e4c4427475e2b92bcb/1750977327/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748918473","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3302540/65453968/2534c7bb953dd0a6110c95e4c4427475e2b92bcb/1750977327/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748918473","id":257143717,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143717/33acce12aa10658b5bd64a387b82e831f4c986f4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748918473"}],"name":"Veil : Black Blood","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul